1
00:00:00,333 --> 00:00:01,967
Kalau dari 2010,

2
00:00:01,967 --> 00:00:05,000
kamu nabung saham Rp 5 juta tiap bulan,

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,200
sekarang jadi berapa?

4
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:08,933
Ini namanya DCA,

5
00:00:08,933 --> 00:00:12,100
singkatan dari Dollar Cost Averaging,

6
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:13,767
artinya beli rutin dengan jumlah

7
00:00:13,767 --> 00:00:15,233
yang sama.

8
00:00:15,233 --> 00:00:16,300
Satu lagi,

9
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:18,500
nggak pernah jual.

10
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:21,633
Total modal kamu jadi Rp 1 miliar lebih.

11
00:00:21,633 --> 00:00:24,567
IHSG, indeks saham Indonesia,

12
00:00:24,567 --> 00:00:27,200
mulai dari 2.600-an.

13
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:29,167
Lalu naik tiga kali lipat lebih,

14
00:00:29,167 --> 00:00:31,800
sampai 8.600.

15
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:35,200
Terus… 2026 datang.

16
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:37,133
Garis biru itu modal kamu,

17
00:00:37,133 --> 00:00:38,933
dan selama hijau di atasnya,

18
00:00:38,933 --> 00:00:40,833
kamu untung.

19
00:00:40,833 --> 00:00:42,100
Tahun 2015,

20
00:00:42,100 --> 00:00:43,900
untungmu tinggal tipis.

21
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:45,333
Tapi kamu tetap beli.

22
00:00:46,467 --> 00:00:47,833
Maret 2020,

23
00:00:47,833 --> 00:00:50,800
COVID datang dan kamu sempat rugi.

24
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:52,000
Kamu nggak jual,

25
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:54,867
dan nilainya tembus Rp 1 miliar.

26
00:00:54,867 --> 00:00:56,933
Habis itu naik pelan-pelan.

27
00:00:56,933 --> 00:00:57,867
Di puncaknya,

28
00:00:57,867 --> 00:01:00,833
kamu untung 67%!

29
00:01:00,833 --> 00:01:03,067
Tapi masuk 2026,

30
00:01:03,067 --> 00:01:05,867
IHSG anjlok 35%.

31
00:01:07,433 --> 00:01:09,867
Uangmu yang tadinya Rp 1,6 miliar,

32
00:01:09,867 --> 00:01:12,933
Juni tinggal Rp 1 miliar lebih dikit.

33
00:01:12,933 --> 00:01:14,700
Lebih dari setengah miliar hilang,

34
00:01:14,700 --> 00:01:16,700
cuma dalam enam bulan.

35
00:01:16,700 --> 00:01:17,400
Hari ini,

36
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:21,033
modal Rp 1 miliar jadi hampir Rp 1,2 miliar.

37
00:01:21,033 --> 00:01:23,267
Untungnya 15% lebih,

38
00:01:23,267 --> 00:01:26,567
atau cuma 1,7% setahun.

39
00:01:26,567 --> 00:01:28,233
DCA bikin kamu nggak pusing kapan

40
00:01:28,233 --> 00:01:30,300
beli, tapi hasilnya tergantung

41
00:01:30,300 --> 00:01:32,067
kapan kamu jual.

42
00:01:32,067 --> 00:01:33,733
Hakabot punya banyak indikator

43
00:01:33,733 --> 00:01:35,000
racikan sendiri,

44
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:37,733
tinggal klik langsung muncul di chart.

45
00:01:37,733 --> 00:01:39,533
Kelihatan broker mana yang nambah,

46
00:01:39,533 --> 00:01:42,067
keluar, sampai untung ruginya.

47
00:01:42,067 --> 00:01:43,667
Pemilik saham tiap perusahaan,

48
00:01:43,667 --> 00:01:45,300
tampil rapi.

49
00:01:45,300 --> 00:01:46,567
Screener siap pakai,

50
00:01:46,567 --> 00:01:48,900
bantu nyaring saham yang jelek.

51
00:01:48,900 --> 00:01:50,567
Cek di hakabot.com.
